{"identity_key": "bilibili:1012984396315099161", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1012984396315099161", "content": "「缘之空」「悠之空」即将登录Steam平台❗️\n\n一部开创性的作品，在2008年面世之时凭借其超越时代的质量和大胆叛逆的题材叫好又叫座。次年的续作《悠之空》增添了两位次要角色的故事，并为原作的人物故事画上了完美的句号。随后播出的TV动画不仅收获了大批粉丝，还因其优秀的人物塑造对一批观众的审美造成了深远的影响。时隔16年，春日野兄妹的故事即将登录Steam平台，奥木染夏日的微风，能否给这冬日带来几分暖意呢？", "publisher": "QC株式会社", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1012984396315099161", "published_at": "2024-12-20T10:56:49+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-13T15:27:25.426351+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/f6b1ad667d94c6d632fed73a3c1291013537110793455821.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/11bca4b2cc1d638f8e5adaa9b3b1d8ed3537110793455821.png"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_3537110793455821", "uid": "3537110793455821", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 107, "retweets": 6, "replies": 140}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
